                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "42e6ec07-5f8e-40eb-a3ea-be934937c4cb",
                                "sense_id": "bf2b4507-225d-30e5-9b99-6be96351e0c4",
                                "text": "Pitch contour: falling [lɑː˦˨]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bcc1dc72-900d-4a95-8b61-ca9a3b4d10c2",
                                "sense_id": "bf2b4507-225d-30e5-9b99-6be96351e0c4",
                                "text": "In other words, you’re the one who started it lah!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aecc28dd-b152-48f5-b321-62f4abce34e9",
                                "sense_id": "bf2b4507-225d-30e5-9b99-6be96351e0c4",
                                "text": "“Huh? SAP school? Oh, you mean Chinese schools lah.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4fc2ac0a-ff3f-3c38-9a0d-b90c8216d065",
                        "entry_id": "f5aaf064-4dd4-3729-9a31-2739797cdbf0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Used to express realisation, or vexation when something is already obvious."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Manglish",
                            "Singlish"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3fc601cc-4dbe-4850-b1b7-a59ca5008af7",
                                "sense_id": "4fc2ac0a-ff3f-3c38-9a0d-b90c8216d065",
                                "text": "Pitch contour: falling [lɑː˦˨]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bbba2f37-1b16-4378-9846-23773687310d",
                                "sense_id": "4fc2ac0a-ff3f-3c38-9a0d-b90c8216d065",
                                "text": "So in the end it wasn’t my fault lah!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "714abbfb-f022-4064-92d9-62d9a827cbec",
                                "sense_id": "4fc2ac0a-ff3f-3c38-9a0d-b90c8216d065",
                                "text": "Do it yourself lah! Always need me to help is it?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c07e4a24-92b8-464b-96d4-c9b7662db137",
                                "sense_id": "4fc2ac0a-ff3f-3c38-9a0d-b90c8216d065",
                                "text": "When Richard was going to join Anglo-Chinese School I expected the father to bring him to see the Headmaster, after all he was from ACS himself, but he couldn't be bothered. (Emily imitates Kheong's brusque brush-off) 'You look after it, you arrange it lah!'"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2b288d26-ba7f-3bbe-a19b-799aa346c69f",
                        "entry_id": "f5aaf064-4dd4-3729-9a31-2739797cdbf0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Reinforces the factuality of an assertive statement made to correct an inaccurate, underlying assumption."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
